    "reviewed_facets": {
      "full_page_and_current_sources": "Complete rewards, highlights, checklist, short walkthrough and long dialogue walkthrough read. 35 exact current script keys inspected, including both Ella zone aliases, ordinary and triggered Venril keys, the four active version-0 numeric City of Mist reavers, and Sky soul/essence carrier death handlers. No Perl reconversion needed. No Ranger script is excluded in the actual quests map; static NPC exclusion matches are separately recorded, never inferred from npc_types.exclude.",
      "precursor_items": "Telin action gives Worn Note20472 ->Greater Faydark Faelin Ring20446 and despawn ->Giz Dark Metal Coin20447 plus hostile TeirDal Reaver20190 ->Telin Worn Coin20448 ->Althele Braided Amulet20450 ->Sionae Frayed Amulet20451 ->Nuien same20451 ->Teloa consumes it and signals ceremony. Corruptor15153 Tome20452 ->Althele Earth Note18959, cleanup. No requirement to kill the optional reavers was added.",
      "dialogue_corrections": "p99-ranger-epic-dialogue restores Kinlo mud/fee/ancient/few-tales/hammers/Erudite route prompts and hand-in directions, Giz betrayal context, Jaeil hail and bowl response, and Usbak hail/refinement instructions. All four existing item/spawn/attack/depop paths are preserved. Existing AF Alrik proposal amended in place to accept the exact Ranger ancient type of bowl prompt as well as ancient bowl; artifacts branch retained and current AF assertion hashes refreshed.",
      "ella_and_hardened_mixture": "Both misty and mistythicket Ella aliases preserve Earth Note18959 as instructions, with two tasks dialogue granting Shiny Tin Bowl17860 as the detailed walkthrough says. Enabled recipe8842 uses Ripened Heartfruit20464, Sweetened Mudroot20465, Speckled Molded Mushroom20466, Chilled Tundra Root20467, one each, to Hardened Mixture20473 and does not replace the bowl. Checklist shorthand saying note directly gives bowl is distinguished from the detailed dialogue protocol.",
      "runecrested_bowl": "Alrik artifact dialogue gives Crushed Pot20457 ->Farios Grocery List20458 ->Nora Provisions20459 ->Farios Receipt20474 ->Alrik Ancient Pattern18960. Merdan Rose12774 ->Painting20475 ->Frontier Mountains skeleton Locket20476 plus despawn ->Niera Powder20456. Kinlo Jade Reaver5664 ->Clay20455. Enabled recipe9178 uses Pattern18960+Clay20455+Powder20456 in station21 ->Runecrested Bowl20460. No minimum pottery skill and no container replacement in baseline metadata.",
      "stones_and_venril": "Ella20473+20460 ->Softly Glowing Stone20462. Remains accepts Firefly Globe10295 and spawns Spirit102123, which accepts Resurrection scroll15392 and spawns hostile triggered Venril102126. Triggered Venril has twenty-minute timer and only Green Stone20461 in its loot table with100% probability, mindrop2/droplimit2; actual engine two-item settlement is unverified. Foloal20462+20461 ->Warmly Glowing Stone20468 ->Telin Ancient Longsword20477. Regular #Venril handler deliberately leaves the existing shared spawn dependency authoritative.",
      "hammers_and_swiftwind": "Jaeil bowl17860 ->hostile Jaeil the Insane39154 and Wretched depop. Insane loot Soulbound Hammer20478; Kinlo optional inspection returns it. Mairee20478 ->Dwarven Smiths Hammer20479;20479+Swirling Sphere20494 ->Hammer of Ancients20485. Kinlo20485 grants Mithril Ore20482 and spawns Usbak67089. Usbak20477 ->Refined Ancient Sword20481 and despawns. Kinlo20482 ->Refined Mithril Blade20483. Telin20481 returns sword and spawns Burning Woods Faelin54237; Faelin20481 ->Swiftwind20487 and depops. Ore is granted by Kinlo within the spawn transaction rather than by a separate Usbak dialogue; existing functional adaptation retained.",
      "earthcaller_and_rewards": "Xanuusus20483+Shattered Emerald20484 ->Earthcaller20488. Existing Druid and Jumjum branches remain unchanged. Swiftwind item has attack30 and haste40 matching the page, implemented as direct item stats rather than worn Swift Spirit; Earthcaller proceffect1928 references Earthcall, whose snapshot includes slow max50, damage -20,25-tick duration metadata. Spell formula/proc settlement and complete rendered item effects are not certified. Quest minimum-level policy does not imply removing item proc-level requirements.",
      "acquisition_links": "Exact static joins cover Corruptor Tome,8 black-reaver candidate rows with distinct version0/version1 populations, triggered Venril stone, Jaeil hammer, essence-tamer sphere, and9 named Hate emerald candidates including separately labelled hateplaneb records. Active version0 reavers90000/90010/90012/90199 have numeric Lua death cycles and retain unsourced80% continuation fallback. Soul carrier71017 death ->two essence carriers71070; each death ->tamer71071. Spell237 Dance of Fireflies summons10295, has Druid level1 and TimeOfDay2 metadata; Resurrection392 cleric49 maps from scroll15392 with merchant candidates. These joins are not live acquisition proof.",
      "gates_and_adaptations": "Friendly quest-only faction policy and no minimum epic1.0 level preserved. Level1 focused fixtures verify representative entry and all documented primary exchanges. East Karana remains the documented player-versus-attackers approximation, with ceremony90/120-second timers, Corruptor five-minute idle window, reaver ten-minute window and existing cleanup. No undocumented IDs, numbers, APIs, probability adjustments, world stat changes or raid schedule rewrites introduced.",
      "runtime_checks": "98 strict isolated fixture scenarios passed through pinned gopher-lua normalizer:42 current proposedFile scenarios and56 baseline_verification scenarios, no baseline_reproduction counted as proposal coverage. Tests capture expected exchanges, missing/wrong/surplus offers, level1, concrete hostile spawn IDs, depops, ceremony timers, Sky triggers and reaver branches. Mock ReturnHandinItems evidence is not actual inventory rollback, combat, lifecycle or UI verification."
